OL,3,AAt least one dead after car crashes
OL,4,Ainto crowd in northern France
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least one person has been killed and
OL,7,F10 people injured after a car crashed
OL,8,Finto a group of people near a train
OL,9,Fstation in northern France, police say.
OL,11,FOne person had been arrested and taken
OL,12,Finto custody after authorities launched
OL,13,Fa major emergency response in Caen, in
OL,14,Fthe Normandy region, local officials
OL,15,Ftold the BBC.
OL,17,FThe incident took place near a bar,
OL,18,Fwith local media reporting that a fight
OL,19,Fhad broken out there before the
OL,20,Fincident took place.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
