OL,3,AAt least one dead after car crashes
OL,4,Ainto crowd in northern France
OL,5,
OL,6,FSocial media videos from the scene
OL,7,Fappear to show crowds gathering around
OL,8,Fpolice cars and ambulances, where a
OL,9,Flarge area is cordoned off.
